  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5995fb7029cddc1419ef93cd758fd2f6, type: 3}
  m_Name: LavaLog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  logNum: 3
  log:
  - This area seems to have some strange rules.
  - 'Rule no.1:

    After standing on a pink pad you must stand on 2 blue pads.'
  - 'Rule no.2:

    If a pad has a number it must be equal to the number of previous'
  - pads stood on. This number resets to 0 when you have stood on 10 pads.
  - 'Rule no.3:

    After 3 blue pads you must step on a pink pad.'
  - 'Rule no.4:

    You must stand on every pad to suceed.'
  - 'Tip:

    You also might be able to rewind a number pad to a smaller numer.'
  summary: Strange Platforms
